lor\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.54.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">April 14th, 2024</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p><p><i><big>\"A machine to color fabrics and vases. Requires a jar of dye in one input, and the item in another output. An item will not be processed unless dye is present.\"</big></i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>This machine requires the items listed below in order to function:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Flowers\" title=\"Flowers\">Dyes</a> - This will change the color of the items you insert</li></ul>\n<p>Items able to be dyed:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Sand\" title=\"Sand\">Glass</a> - This will turn into <a href=\"/wiki/Stained_Glass\" title=\"Stained Glass\">Stained Glass</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Fabric_Roll\" title=\"Fabric Roll\">Fabric Rolls</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Medium_Vase\" title=\"Medium Vase\">Vases</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Brick\" title=\"Brick\">Bricks</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Universal_Stud\" title=\"Universal Stud\">Universal Stud</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Tall_Candle\" title=\"Tall Candle\">Candle</a> (every size)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Candle_Holder\" title=\"Candle Holder\">Candle holder</a> (including the <a href=\"/wiki/Fancy_Candle_Holder\" title=\"Fancy Candle Holder\">fancy version</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Backpack\" title=\"Backpack\">Backpacks</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span title=\"Write the exact version of the bug fix if you know (please)\">Until 2026, the jars were not given back when the \"Remove Dye Contents\" button was pressed</span></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903012108\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.066 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.087 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 97/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 729/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 106/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019441/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   66.973      1 -total\n 91.94%   61.574      1 Template:Objects\n  7.90%    5.293      1 Template:Stub\n  3.72%    2.489      1 Template:Mainonly\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:2619-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903012108 and revision id 21808. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Stubs"],"links":[{"title":"Flora Laura","exists":true},{"title":"Flowering meadow","exists":true},{"title":"Backpack","exists":true},{"title":"Brick","exists":true},{"title":"Candle Holder","exists":true},{"title":"Fabric Roll","exists":true},{"title":"Fancy Candle Holder","exists":true},{"title":"Flowers","exists":true},{"title":"Medium Vase","exists":true},{"title":"Sand","exists":true},{"title":"Stained Glass","exists":true},{"title":"Tall Candle","exists":true},{"title":"Universal Stud","exists":true},{"title":"Category:Stubs","exists":true}],"images":["Dyemachine.png","Dyemachineboxed.png"]}
